<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Fina, dorada</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Longitud</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">~800 metros</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Anchura</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Variable, 30–50 metros</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20"><strong>Oleaje</strong></td>
<td class="py-3 pr-4 border-b border-black/20">Generalmente suave, mar abierto</td>
</tr>
<tr>
